          "id": "7268a49e2a3776d31d3d08939a269a0a8a0f8cd8",
          "message": "docs: callinterface doc comments (#16396)\n\nI didn't know about the call_interfaces.nr file when I documented the\n\"call\" functions in the PrivateContext and PublicContext. I've\ncopied-over (with some very minor tweaks) the\nalready-approved-and-merged doc comments for function calls from\nPrivateContext/PublicContext into `call_interfaces.nr`, because most\ndevs will be exposed to those wrapper functions, rather than the\nfunctions in the context.\n\nNo code changes; just comments.",
